## RelationType: categorized by

Source IRI: `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/categorizedBy`. Source definition: relation between a lower-order classifier by a higher-order classifier such that the latter classifier categorizes the former. This BKN projection stores the target entity ID in `categorized_by_target_id`.

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| classifier | classifier | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| categorized_by_target_id | entity_id |
